@startuml 使用案例7_1_使用者註冊
title 使用案例7.1: 使用者註冊流程

actor "訪客" as Guest
participant "Register.vue" as RegisterPage
participant "auth.ts(store)" as AuthStore
participant "client.ts(axios)" as APIClient
participant "auth.py(blueprint)" as AuthBlueprint
participant "auth_service.py" as AuthService
participant "PendingRegistration(model)" as PendingModel
participant "User(model)" as UserModel
participant "email_service.py" as EmailService
database "MySQL" as DB

== 1. 進入註冊頁面 ==
Guest -> RegisterPage: 點選「註冊」按鈕\n訪問「/register」路由
activate RegisterPage
RegisterPage -> RegisterPage: 初始化表單\nform = reactive({})
note right
  表單欄位:
  - email (必填)
  - password (必填)
  - confirmPassword (必填)
  - username (必填)
  - first_name (必填)
  - last_name (必填)
  - phone_number (必填)
  - region (必填)
  - role (必填, 預設: GENERAL_MEMBER)
end note
RegisterPage --> Guest: 顯示註冊表單
deactivate RegisterPage

== 2. 填寫註冊資料 ==
Guest -> RegisterPage: 輸入註冊資料
activate RegisterPage
note right
  訪客填寫:
  - Email 地址
  - 密碼 (至少8字元，含英文與數字)
  - 確認密碼
  - 使用者名稱
  - 名字、姓氏
  - 電話號碼
  - 選擇地區
  - 選擇帳號類型 (個人/收容所)
end note
RegisterPage -> RegisterPage: v-model 雙向綁定\n更新 form.* 資料
RegisterPage --> Guest: 顯示輸入內容
deactivate RegisterPage

== 3. 提交註冊表單 ==
Guest -> RegisterPage: 點擊「註冊」按鈕
activate RegisterPage
RegisterPage -> RegisterPage: handleRegister()\n@submit.prevent
RegisterPage -> RegisterPage: validateForm()\n驗證所有欄位
note right
  前端驗證項目:
  1. Email 格式檢查
  2. 密碼強度檢查 (8+ chars, letters + numbers)
  3. 兩次密碼一致性
  4. 必填欄位檢查
  5. 電話號碼格式
end note

alt 驗證失敗
    RegisterPage -> RegisterPage: errors.* = 錯誤訊息
    RegisterPage --> Guest: 顯示錯誤提示\n(紅框 + 錯誤文字)
    note left
      常見錯誤:
      - "請輸入有效的 Email 地址"
      - "密碼至少 8 個字元，需包含英文和數字"
      - "密碼不一致"
      - "請選擇地區"
    end note
else 驗證通過
    RegisterPage -> RegisterPage: isLoading = true\n禁用按鈕
    RegisterPage -> RegisterPage: 組裝 registerData
    note right
      registerData = {
        email, password,
        username, first_name, last_name,
        phone_number, region, role
      }
    end note
end

== 4. 呼叫 API 註冊 ==
RegisterPage -> AuthStore: authStore.register(registerData)
activate AuthStore
AuthStore -> APIClient: api.post('/auth/register', data)
activate APIClient
APIClient -> APIClient: 添加 baseURL\n+ JWT Token (若有)
APIClient -> AuthBlueprint: POST /auth/register\nContent-Type: application/json
activate AuthBlueprint

== 5. 後端驗證 ==
AuthBlueprint -> AuthBlueprint: 取得 request.json
AuthBlueprint -> AuthBlueprint: 檢查必填欄位\n['email', 'password']
alt 缺少必填欄位
    AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 400 Bad Request\n{"message": "缺少必填欄位"}
    APIClient --> AuthStore: error (400)
    AuthStore --> RegisterPage: error
    RegisterPage -> RegisterPage: errorMessage = "缺少必填欄位"
    RegisterPage --> Guest: 顯示錯誤訊息
    note left: 中斷流程
else 欄位齊全
    AuthBlueprint -> AuthBlueprint: 取得可選欄位\n(username, phone_number, region, role)
    AuthBlueprint -> AuthBlueprint: 取得客戶端資訊\n(client_ip, user_agent)
end

== 6. 建立待註冊記錄 ==
AuthBlueprint -> AuthService: register_pending(\nemail, password, username,\nphone_number, region, address,\nclient_ip, user_agent)
activate AuthService

AuthService -> UserModel: User.query.filter_by(email=email).first()
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE email=:email\nLIMIT 1
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: User 或 None
deactivate DB
UserModel --> AuthService: existing_user
deactivate UserModel

alt Email 已被註冊
    AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: raise ConflictError\n("此 email 已被註冊")
    AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 409 Conflict\n{"message": "此 email 已被註冊"}
    APIClient --> AuthStore: error (409)
    AuthStore --> RegisterPage: error
    RegisterPage -> RegisterPage: errorMessage = "此 Email 已被註冊"
    RegisterPage --> Guest: 顯示錯誤訊息\n(紅色提示框)
    note left: 中斷流程
else Email 未被註冊
    AuthService -> PendingModel: PendingRegistration.query.filter_by(email).first()
    activate PendingModel
    PendingModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM pending_registrations\nWHERE email=:email\nLIMIT 1
    activate DB
    DB --> PendingModel: PendingRegistration 或 None
    deactivate DB
    PendingModel --> AuthService: existing_pending
    deactivate PendingModel
    
    alt 已有未過期的待註冊記錄
        AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: return existing_pending\n(重用現有記錄)
        note right: 避免重複發送驗證碼
    else 無待註冊記錄
        AuthService -> AuthService: hash_password(password)\n→ password_hash
        AuthService -> AuthService: generate_numeric_code(6)\n→ 驗證碼 (6位數字)
        AuthService -> AuthService: hash_verification_code(code)\n→ code_hash
        AuthService -> AuthService: expires = now + 15分鐘
        
        AuthService -> PendingModel: pending = PendingRegistration(\nemail, username, phone_number,\nregion, password_hash,\ncode_hash, expires, client_ip, user_agent)
        activate PendingModel
        PendingModel -> DB: INSERT INTO pending_registrations\nVALUES (...)
        activate DB
        DB --> PendingModel: pending_id (auto_increment)
        deactivate DB
        PendingModel --> AuthService: pending
        deactivate PendingModel
        
        AuthService -> DB: db.session.commit()
        activate DB
        DB --> AuthService: 提交成功
        deactivate DB
    end
end

== 7. 發送驗證碼郵件 ==
AuthService -> EmailService: send_registration_code_email(\nuser_email=email,\nusername=username,\ncode=code,\nexpires_minutes=15)
activate EmailService
EmailService -> EmailService: 組裝郵件內容
note right
  郵件主旨: "[App] 註冊驗證碼"
  郵件內容:
  "您的註冊驗證碼為： {code}
  此驗證碼於 15 分鐘後失效。
  如非您本人操作，請忽略本信。"
end note

EmailService -> EmailService: _send_via_smtp(\nsubject, to_email, body)

alt SMTP 已配置
    EmailService -> EmailService: 讀取 SMTP 設定\n(host, port, user, password)
    EmailService -> EmailService: 建立 EmailMessage
    EmailService -> EmailService: smtplib.SMTP(host, port)\n.starttls().login()
    EmailService --> EmailService: server.send_message(msg)
    note right: 實際發送郵件至 Email
else SMTP 未配置 (開發模式)
    EmailService -> EmailService: logger.warning()\nprint(body)
    note right: 將驗證碼印在後端 console
end

EmailService --> AuthService: 發送成功 (True)
deactivate EmailService

AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: return pending
deactivate AuthService

== 8. 回傳註冊結果 ==
AuthBlueprint -> AuthBlueprint: 遮蔽 Email\nmasked = local[:3] + '***@' + domain
note right
  範例:
  abc@example.com → abc***@example.com
  test123@gmail.com → tes***@gmail.com
end note

AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 200 OK\n{\n  "message": "驗證碼已發送至電子郵件",\n  "pending_id": pending.pending_id,\n  "masked_email": "a***@example.com",\n  "expires_in": 900 (15分鐘)\n}
deactivate AuthBlueprint
APIClient --> AuthStore: response.data
deactivate APIClient
AuthStore --> RegisterPage: resp = {\npending_id, masked_email, expires_in\n}
deactivate AuthStore

== 9. 導向驗證頁面 ==
RegisterPage -> RegisterPage: console.log('register response:', resp)
RegisterPage -> RegisterPage: 取得 pending_id, masked_email
RegisterPage -> RegisterPage: router.push({\nname: 'VerifyRegistration',\nquery: { pending_id, masked, role }\n})
RegisterPage --> Guest: 導向 /verify-registration?pending_id=xxx
note right
  導向驗證頁面，並帶上:
  - pending_id (待註冊記錄 ID)
  - masked (遮蔽後的 Email)
  - role (帳號類型)
end note
deactivate RegisterPage

Guest -> Guest: 前往 Email 信箱\n查看驗證碼
note left
  下一步:
  訪客在驗證頁面輸入
  收到的 6 位數驗證碼
  完成註冊
  
  參考: 使用案例 7.1.1
  (Email 驗證)
end note

@enduml